    PASS panel runs a real close animation
    PASS open clip-path is the resting polygon
    PASS mid-close clip-path is a polygon (interpolating, not snapped)
    PASS mid-close clip-path is not the fold end value
    PASS clip-path advances between 50% and 90% of the fold
    PASS the fold ends somewhere new
    PASS panel and scrim both closed
