    PASS open uses the sheet keyframes
    PASS sheet travels the full sheet height up from below the fold
    PASS sheet comes to rest at translateY 0
    PASS sheet leaves no desktop clip-path behind
    PASS close uses the sheet keyframes
    PASS close starts from translateY 0
    PASS close slides the sheet away again
    PASS mobile panel closes
